### DAY 19 : file upload (multer + validation magic-bytes via
### file-type + stockage non statique + controle d'acces PUBLIC/PRIVATE
### via /api/uploads).
###
### L'upload multipart n'est pas pratique a scripter proprement en
### .http (fichier binaire requis), donc test de reference via curl
### depuis un terminal :
###
### curl -c cookies.txt -X POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register \
###   -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
###   -d '{"email":"upload19@test.com","name":"Upload19","password":"12345678"}'
###
### curl -b cookies.txt -X POST http://localhost:4000/api/uploads \
###   -F "file=@monimage.png;type=image/png"
### -> 201 { id, filename, originalName, mimeType, size, visibility: "PRIVATE", ownerId, createdAt }
###
